  "title": "Firecracker Shrimp Roll with Crab Aioli",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s explosively seasoned po&#39; boy-style firecracker shrimp roll with crab aioli recipe pairs hot buttermilk-battered shrimp with cold, crab aioli.",
